---
title: Data Model (SurrealDB)
description: SurrealDB schema (tables, fields, constraints), the versioning pattern, and the Redis/S3 layout.
---

Schema is defined incrementally in `sql/migrations/*.surql` (001–017),
applied in order by `cmd/migrate` (`task db:migrate`). All tables are
`SCHEMAFULL` unless noted.

## Identity & accounts

### `user`
| Field | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `first_name`, `last_name` | string | |
| `email` | string | `ASSERT string::is_email($value)`, unique index |
| `password_hash` | string | bcrypt |
| `storage_used_bytes` | int | DEFAULT 0 — running total of object-storage bytes (migration 017) |
| `created_at` | datetime | DEFAULT `time::now()`, READONLY |

### `user_key`
Per-user end-to-end-encryption key material (Account Master Key wrapping).
| Field | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `user` | record\<user\> | READONLY |
| `recovery_wrapped_amk` | string | AMK wrapped with recovery key |
| `password_wrapped_amk` | option\<string\> | AMK wrapped with Argon2-derived password key |
| `argon2_salt` | string | |
| `argon2_time` | int | DEFAULT 3 |
| `argon2_memory` | int | DEFAULT 65536 |
| `argon2_threads` | int | DEFAULT 4 |
| `argon2_keylen` | int | DEFAULT 32 |
| `created_at` | datetime | VALUE `time::now()`, READONLY |
| `updated_at` | datetime | VALUE `time::now()` |

### `device`
Per-device wrapped copy of the AMK, for the device-invite/QR approval flow.
| Field | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `user` | record\<user\> | READONLY |
| `name` | option\<string\> | |
| `public_key` | string | READONLY |
| `wrapped_amk` | string | AMK wrapped with this device's public key |
| `created_at` | datetime | VALUE `time::now()`, READONLY |
| `last_seen_at` | datetime | VALUE `time::now()` |

